{% comment %}
  Renders the color filter facet chip as a flat hex-color circle, sourced from
  the filtercolors metaobject's hexcode field (fallback image_asset if no hex).

  Per plp-color-filter: this is the *filter* chip (an abstract color family
  spanning many products), deliberately not an image-swatch like the PLP
  card/PDP chips (ob-card-swatches / ob-swatch-input) — those represent one
  specific purchasable variant, this represents a group.

  filtercolors' hexcode field is a plain text field, not Shopify's native
  Color field type (confirmed via metaobjectDefinitions), so Shopify does not
  auto-populate value.swatch for this filter — this snippet resolves the hex
  itself by matching the filter value against shop.metaobjects.filtercolors.

  NOT YET VERIFIED LIVE: authored before the Kleur filter had propagated in
  Search & Discovery. Matches by value.value (assumed metaobject GID) first,
  falls back to matching by label text, since the exact filter value shape
  couldn't be confirmed against a live filter at authoring time.

  Accepts:
  - value: {Object} a color filter's value object (from facets.liquid)

  Usage:
  {% render 'ob-facet-color-chip', value: value %}
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  assign matched_hex = null
  assign matched_image = null
  for entry in shop.metaobjects.filtercolors.values
    assign is_match = false
    if entry.id == value.value
      assign is_match = true
    elsif entry.label == value.label
      assign is_match = true
    endif
    if is_match
      assign matched_hex = entry.hexcode
      assign matched_image = entry.image_asset
      break
    endif
  endfor
-%}
<span
  class="ob-facet-color-chip{% if matched_hex == blank and matched_image == blank %} ob-facet-color-chip--unavailable{% endif %}"
  {% if matched_hex != blank %}
    style="--ob-facet-color-chip-bg: {{ matched_hex }};"
  {% endif %}
>
  {%- if matched_hex == blank and matched_image != blank -%}
    {%- assign chip_alt = value.label | escape -%}
    {{
      matched_image
      | image_url: width: 40
      | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: chip_alt, sizes: '20px', widths: '20,40'
    }}
  {%- endif -%}
</span>
